        "test": false,
        "languageProficiency": false
      },
      "notes": "ESL Program Specialist PK-12. Add-on to a PA Instructional I or II certificate (CSPG #68, rev. 7/1/2023). State-approved preparation program with field experience/student teaching with ESL students. No state ESL test (per PDE ESL FAQ)."
    },
    "sei": {
      "mandatedForAllTeachers": false,
      "notes": "No SEI-style in-service mandate. However, 22 Pa. Code § 49.13(b)(4)(i) requires all teacher preparation programs to include at least 3 credits or 90 hours addressing the instructional needs of English language learners — a pre-service requirement, not the AZ/CA/MA SEI endorsement model."
    }
